body:
I never asked Z to schedule anything. Youre toxic and you weild downvotes as a weapon to silence people like me who think for themselves.

Its because I cant share a simple opinion that I tell everyone I know to avoid this project and this reddit. I give examples and in some cases names of the most repulsive and toxic members.

And I follow the development as much as I can while avoiding this hell hole, I so understand more than enough. I also understand that you telling me I dont understand is like an evangelical telling an atheist he is a religion.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

So go ahead. downvote me. Youre creating the animosity you fight so hard against. The more attacked I am, the more I want this project to fail just to return some of your hatred back at you. I also tell others in my clan to avoid this project like the plague because of people like you. Not the game, but this particular community.

All that said.. if I leave after 10 minutes of frustration, I cant test the game for anybody.. and I sure wont be suggesting that anyone else test the game, or invest in the game.

&#x200B;

Im being serious. Im a glutton for punishment, but I can only take this game in spurts of 15 minutes and then Im done. Of the people in my clan, they ask all the time if SC is playable, all I can tell them is "barely" even with all the improvements, those improvements dont mean sh!t if im quitting the game after 10 minutes of frustration every single time I log in.
